msgctxt "ai_summary_parts_consent"
msgid ""
"Because you chose to also summarize older messages, a long backlog is sent "
"in up to {parts} parts of about 12,000 characters, one request each, plus "
"one last request that joins the summaries: up to {requests} requests in all."
