msgctxt "new_contact_phone_hint"
msgid ""
"Saves the contact in WhatsApp and requests synchronization with the phone's "
"address book. Completion on the phone cannot be verified here."
msgstr ""
"Uloží kontakt do WhatsAppu a požádá o synchronizaci s adresářem telefonu. "
